WEBVTT

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:03.160
Na simulizi zetu kwa pamoja
zinatakiwa kuwa na hadithi zetu binafsi,

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:06.456
sanaa,

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:08.680
tafakari za dini,

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.000
maandiko

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:16.376
na ndio, hata ngoma.

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.000
(Kicheko)

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:23.376
Inatakiwa iwe misemo ya pamoja,

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:27.816
kwa sababu hadithi binafsi
hutengeneza namna

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:31.760
ambapo tutashindanisha hadithi moja
dhidi ya nyingine.